@startuml
actor CUSTOMER
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "NestJS Auth API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

CUSTOMER -> App : Nhập identifier + password
App -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/login
API -> DB : Tìm user theo email/phone
DB --> API : User + passwordHash + role/status
API -> API : So khớp bcrypt, kiểm tra ACTIVE
API -> API : Tạo accessToken + refreshToken
API -> DB : Lưu hash/metadata refresh token
API --> App : 200 {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
App -> App : Lưu token an toàn
App --> CUSTOMER : Hiển thị màn hình theo role
@enduml
